{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_01",
  "title": "注意事項",
  "storyCode": "RS-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "92a3ad96978f634676ae85322767f7efa3d4fc716881f59248b42102bfb11fbf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的記憶中有一片茫茫白雪\n我記得小的時候，我躺在木頭做的小床上，屋內壁爐裡的柴火劈啪作響，窗外漫天大雪徹夜不停。\n風聲在耳畔呼呼作響，一隻大手撫著我的頭，有人低聲哄我入睡。\n我就在暖暖的安心感中沉入夢鄉。\n我曾一度以為，那是烏薩斯。\n媽媽卻告訴我，不是的，羅莎琳，那不是烏薩斯。\n那是謝拉格的風。\n那是謝拉格的雪。\n那是……我出生的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "所以……羅莎琳你是一直到上高等學校，才知道自己其實是在謝拉格出生的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "對啊，我媽之前完全沒提過還有這回事，最開始我還以為她在開玩笑呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "小時候的事我都忘得差不多了，就記得到處都是雪……烏薩斯不也到處都是雪嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "這誰分得清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "唔，這麼說的話確實是有幾分相似。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "不過在我的記憶裡，烏薩斯比謝拉格要更冷點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊……這倒是沒錯，確實還是烏薩斯更冷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "大叔你也去過烏薩斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哈哈，都是好多年前的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那時候沒什麼機會好好逛逛，可惜了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那你下次再來，我來當你嚮導。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "烏薩斯別的不說，聖駿堡的景色還是一等一的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那太好了，呃，看來我得多準備兩件厚外套。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "在有機會去烏薩斯赴約之前，還是先讓我為羅莎琳小姐做嚮導吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那麼，就先說說這輛車的目的地——新建的那座耶拉岡德像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "它就建在銀心湖的湖心島上，十分顯眼，一出車站立刻就能看到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "當然，對羅莎琳你來說，耶拉岡德像還不是重點……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你的這趟謝拉格之旅，有比觀光更重要的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "對。沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我要先替我媽看一眼耶拉岡德像，這是她……她走之前強調過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "然後我就轉道去銀心湖旁邊的那座山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我得把這個盒子裡的東西，送到那座山的山頂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "這裡面是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我也不知道，我媽沒跟我說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "她只讓我把這個丟到那座山上，這樣她就能心滿意足了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "孤身一人回到陌生的故鄉，只為完成母親的願望……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "多麼孝順，多麼好的孩子，真是令人感動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呃，也沒有你說的這麼誇張啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那麼，在那之後羅莎琳你的計劃是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "把東西送上山之後？沒什麼具體的計劃，可能四處逛逛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "也有可能……會去找我爸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你的父親還在謝拉格？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "若是尋人，或許我能幫得上忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "真的嗎？可是我不知道他的名字，也記不得他長什麼樣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不過我媽跟我說過，我爸長得很好看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "啊哈，一位美男子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "沒錯！據說是當時謝拉格有名有姓的美男子，好像還挺有名氣的嘞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "對了，我媽還說過，我的眼睛最像我爸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "謝拉格的有名人？美男子？唔……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "有人選？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "如果那位先生能生出羅莎琳你這個年紀的女兒，那麼只能是在維多利亞留學期間……唔……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "不，不不不。再怎麼說也……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "當時，烏薩斯，難道說……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "到底怎麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "呃，哈哈，我得再尋思尋思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "要是能找到他那最好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "來一場令人感動的父女相認？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不太一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我只是要看看，這個十多年沒出現的混帳東西到底是個什麼樣的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "歡迎各位乘坐最新的“聖女號”列車，我們的列車正處於正常行駛中，您可以透過兩側的車窗觀賞謝拉格美麗的自然風光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "在列車行駛過程中，我們還將在車內特別進行謝拉格當地特產的售賣活動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "謝拉格特色乳酪零食及人氣馱獸盲盒均有販賣，更有喀蘭貿易公司推出的精裝版高山雪水限量發售，產地直銷，聖女嚴選，品質有保障！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "有需要的乘客可以自由選購……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "不好意思，請問一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "啊，這位乘客，請問您想來點什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "我不是要看商品……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "您不要看普通商品？那這款精裝版高山雪水要看一下嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "這款產品是三族議會的指定用水，聖女大人也非常喜愛呢，我們這班車到貨不多，非常難得，現在購買只需四弗朗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看熱鬧的乘客",
      "text": "嘶……四弗朗？這都夠我下館子請客吃一頓了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "雖然是貴了一點，但您看這包裝，這純淨的感覺，特別符合先生您的氣質！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "……不必了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "就要……這個盲盒吧，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "謝謝惠顧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "距離下一站到站還有多長時間？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "這次列車為直達列車，下一站就是終點站銀心湖了，中間不會停靠其他站。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "距離到站還有兩個小時！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "如果想在中途下車，更加深入地觀覽沿線的風光，我們的線路上也有每站停車的車次可供選擇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "好的，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列車員",
      "text": "不客氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（……）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（盲盒？這小東西這麼受歡迎嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（不管怎麼看，都只不過是個沒什麼意思的小擺飾罷了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（……還有兩個小時，時間就夠了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（接下來……嗯？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽獸",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "羽獸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽獸",
      "text": "（狠啄）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "什麼……？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽獸們",
      "text": "（滿地亂飛）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽獸們",
      "text": "（四處攻擊）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽獸們",
      "text": "嘎——嘎嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吃驚的老鄉",
      "text": "哎，我的羽獸！我的羽獸怎麼都跑出來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的老鄉",
      "text": "哪裡呢！我來幫你抓！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的老鄉",
      "text": "我也來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘氣的小孩",
      "text": "媽媽，我也想去抓羽獸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（……不好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘氣的小孩",
      "text": "啊，叔叔！叔叔你要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘氣的小孩",
      "text": "叔叔也一起來幫忙好不好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘氣的小孩",
      "text": "抓羽獸太好玩了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "…………",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（……呼。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（小小羽獸和幼兒相加，竟會有如此威力。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（謝拉格確實不可小覷。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（不過，這倒正好給了我一個檢查車廂的正當理由。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "下午好，先生們，請問這裡有人看到過逃走的羽獸嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "沒有？好的，抱歉打擾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（沒有異常。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（前面的車廂都沒有可疑之處，現在只剩下最後幾個包廂。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "（看來這次很可能又是白跑一趟了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "打擾一下，請問……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "……要是找到人，我要跟他算算這十多年的帳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "看這個，在來之前我拜託娜塔莉婭和安娜……就是我的兩個朋友，我拜託她們都幫我算好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "生活費、教育費、醫療費，哦對還有情感缺席費——娜塔莉婭特別提出來的——都列出來在這了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "就算長得再帥也不管用！臉又不能當飯吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，情感缺席費，不錯，真不錯，我支持！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗯？哪位，請……\n進……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外國佬",
      "text": "……請問這裡有人看到過逃走的羽獸嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "羽獸？哦，之前確實看到了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "啊對對對！我們確實看到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "這位先生，來來來，我們出去詳細說說羽獸的事兒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊？這有什麼好詳細說的，哎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "搞什麼啊，奇奇怪怪的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯……維多利亞啊。但願沒什麼大事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "好啦，先生，現在我們聊聊羽獸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我很好奇，什麼樣的羽獸，才能勞動“灰禮帽”親自來找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "沒想到子爵閣下也在車上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哦，算了吧，先生，這是我的台詞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我怎麼不知道，“灰禮帽”什麼時候也開始對觀光感興趣了。難道說……是你的提前退休申請終於被批准了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "看來還沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "子爵閣下不必如此試探。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "我不過隱約聽到一些風聲，按照慣例排查而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "這話我可不敢輕易相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "您與我同為公爵閣下分憂，彼此應該多些信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "子爵閣下又為什麼會出現在這裡？剛剛在您身邊的那位女士……是一名烏薩斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "那位女士看起來似乎有點眼熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我必須要說，你這種搭訕女士的方式很過時。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "我並沒有這個意思，但還是感謝提醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "至於我，自然是為了觀光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "嘿，注意你的語氣，“多些信任”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "兩天後就是耶拉岡德像的落成儀式，邀請函都送到我這來了，提前參觀一下也是應有之義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我還買了兩個聖女小雕像，準備當天一起帶去，那東西做得挺好看的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "好了，聊天時間結束，我這裡沒有什麼……“羽獸”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你也該繼續工作了，“灰禮帽”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "您也一樣，子爵閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "希望您沒有忘記我們為什麼會在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（這是最後一間。沒有其他異常。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（除了，克雷加文子爵和他身邊的那個女孩……）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（出現在子爵身邊……她會是什麼身分？看來回去之後，應該好好查一查。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（不過，現在還是先查完這一間——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "打擾——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "失禮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "不，不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "情報裡提到那個人正在山中訓練新兵，不可能會在這裡出現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "應該不會是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "有事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "有事就說，開門好玩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（——？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（竟然真的是她……？！那個希瓦艾什家的黑騎士……）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（還有手上的血跡，是誰讓她動手了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（……有麻煩了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "（不過，這也說明情報沒有錯，這條線路上的列車確實有問題。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "不，在考慮這個問題之前……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "這一批負責觀察鐧的行動的情報員是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "啊，找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "竟然連這樣重要的情報都沒能掌握，這幾個人，等著去軍事法庭作報告吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "你說情報員？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "別怪他們，能追上我的人不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "text": "感謝您為他們說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "實話而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "說吧，你在這做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "你應該不會還沒想好理由吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
